{c_unique}Your Evade transforms you into an angry Lunatic for up to {c_number}15{/c} seconds that explodes dealing {c_important}Command Fallen's{/c} Base damage and you gain {c_random}[100 - 200]%[x]{/c} increased {c_important}Command Fallen{/c} damage every second you are transformed.

While you are an angry Lunatic, your Movement speed is increased by {c_number}60%[x]{/c} and you periodically spawn a Mini Lunatic that seeks enemies. 

